  "notes": "{一|ひと}つ is the native Japanese counter for one.\n\nNATIVE COUNTING (1-10):\n- {一|ひと}つ (1), {二|ふた}つ (2), {三|みっ}つ (3), {四|よっ}つ (4), {五|いつ}つ (5)\n- {六|むっ}つ (6), {七|なな}つ (7), {八|やっ}つ (8), {九|ここの}つ (9), {十|とお} (10)\n\nUSAGE: Used for counting general items when no specific counter applies.",
